{"study_accession":"PRJNA1023845","secondary_study_accession":"SRP464443","title":"Dysregulated gene expression in human rheumatoid arthritis-associated interstitial lung disease(RA-ILD) and rheumatoid arthritis (RA) peripheral blood samples","description":"RA-associated interstitial lung disease (RA-ILD) is an increasingly recognized extra-articular manifestations (EAMs) in the RA, with highly morbidity and mortality. Due to the etiology of RA-ILD is unknown, we collected peripheral blood samples of RA-ILD and RA patients. Differential gene expression analysis was employed to identify key genes, common pathways, and potential drug targets for RA-ILD. Furthermore, RT-qPCR was conducted to verify potential biomarkers in RA-ILD.This study was undertaken to understand the disease's molecular basis better and provide relevant insight into phenotypical alterations and mechanisms involved in RA-ILD pathogenesis.","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":10,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN37673845","study_accession":"PRJNA1023845","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"RA-nonILD5","description":"RA-nonILD5","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM7821534","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2026-10-03","attributes":[["source_name","peripheral blood"],["tissue","peripheral blood"],["disease","nonILD"],["cell_type","peripheral blood mononuclear cell"],["geo_loc_name","missing"],["collection_date","missing"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR26276654","experiment_accession":"SRX21986091","library_layout":"SINGLE","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"MGISEQ-2000RS","read_count":25269315,"base_count":1263465750,"first_public":"2026-10-03","experiment_title":"MGISEQ-2000RS sequencing: GSM7821534: RA-nonILD5 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN37673846","study_accession":"PRJNA1023845","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"RA-nonILD4","description":"RA-nonILD4","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM7821533"